summary:
  The map of readings grows without end.

history:
  It lives in the widget's config. A bounded map lets the oldest reading go;
  an unbounded one is written out whole at every answer.

target:
  package/contents/ui/LoudLogic.js

find:
      return _text(rest.slice(Math.max(0, rest.length - top)));

replace:
      return _text(rest);

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_loudlogic.qml::test_the_map_stops_at_its_cap_and_lets_the_oldest_go.
  Line-neutral.
